sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor S as Streamer (OBS)
    participant IG as Ingest Service
    participant API as API REST
    participant MQ as RabbitMQ (Fila)
    participant ORC as Worker Pool Orchestrator
    participant W as Worker (FFmpeg)
    participant HLS as Volume HLS
    participant PG as PostgreSQL (Primary)
    participant PGR as PostgreSQL (Réplica)

    rect rgb(76, 61, 128)
    Note over S,PGR: Fluxo 1 — Streamer inicia uma live (nova arquitetura)

    S->>IG: Conecta + envia token da live (RTMP / TCP-Socket)
    Note right of S: Comunicação Transiente

    IG->>API: POST /lives (notifica nova live)
    API->>PG: INSERT live (status=active)
    PG-->>PGR: replicação (failover / redundância)

    IG->>MQ: publica evento { token da live }
    Note right of IG: Cap.2 Desacoplamento Temporal

    ORC->>MQ: GET (consome evento da fila)
    Note over ORC: escuta a fila continuamente

    ORC->>W: sobe 1 worker p/ a live<br/>(imagem base + ENV token)
    Note over ORC,W: mapa worker → token (JSON, em memória)

    W->>IG: FFmpeg puxa o RTMP da live
    W->>W: Transcodifica RTMP → HLS (.m3u8 + .ts)
    W->>HLS: Salva chunks de vídeo

    W-->>ORC: Heartbeat / ACK periódico
    Note over ORC,W: Cap.8 Fail-stop — sem ACK → Orchestrator faz respawn com a mesma secret
    end
